{"id":"draft-c02-01","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"反常积分","concept":"无穷限反常积分","concept_id":"C02","parent_training_ids":["calc-improper-002","calc-param-improper-003"],"problem":"证明广义积分$\\int_1^{\\infty}\\sin(x^2)\\,dx$收敛但不绝对收敛，并给出对任意$T>R\\ge1$均成立的精确尾积分上界。无需计算积分的具体值。","solution":"令$u=x^2$，尾积分为$\\int_{R^2}^{T^2}\\sin u/(2\\sqrt u)\\,du$。置$w(u)=1/(2\\sqrt u)$，分部积分得$[-w(u)\\cos u]_{R^2}^{T^2}+\\int_{R^2}^{T^2}w^{\\prime}(u)\\cos u\\,du$。因$w$正且递减，其绝对值不超过$w(R^2)+w(T^2)+\\int_{R^2}^{T^2}|w^{\\prime}|=2w(R^2)=1/R$。由柯西准则，广义积分收敛。绝对值积分换元为$\\int_1^{\\infty}|\\sin u|/(2\\sqrt u)\\,du$。对$n\\ge1$，在$[n\\pi+\\pi/6,n\\pi+5\\pi/6]$上$|\\sin u|\\ge1/2$，故每段贡献至少$\\sqrt\\pi/(6\\sqrt{n+1})$。从$n=N$到$2N-1$的贡献至少$(\\sqrt\\pi/6)N/\\sqrt{2N}=(\\sqrt\\pi/6)\\sqrt{N/2}$，无界，因而不绝对收敛。","answer":"条件收敛；$\\left|\\int_R^T\\sin(x^2)\\,dx\\right|\\le1/R$（$T>R\\ge1$）。","method":"振荡相位广义积分的柯西尾界","difficulty":"基础","variant_kind":"平方相位换元+分部尾界+绝对积分分块下界","scene_spec":{"objects":["积分尾项与$1/R$上界","$u=x^2$及权重$1/(2\\sqrt u)$","每段下界$\\sqrt\\pi/(6\\sqrt{n+1})$","条件收敛与绝对收敛的区分"],"steps":["第一步:换元将振荡项与递减权重分开。","第二步:分部积分给统一精确尾界。","第三步:用柯西准则证明收敛。","第四步:用正弦远离零的区间证明绝对积分发散。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"1c04e799a7ddc9e4e588a8f7b5a774e0392cb6eb4d58f1c5995b9112aba5d35a","math_content_sha256":"d304f2ae550e79756b7b6e6f343d782ef1737d7a27ba4be3dcf42094957f318b","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"scene-batch9-v1-draft-c02-01","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-07\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"fe3576287150709fa595d4fe033e69553cfc44acc8bd9441a4226ad815adbbd4","original_id":"draft-c02-01","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-improper-002","calc-param-improper-003"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"3b5caa8eb4385d1e4e74a7e2fb11a7c4ef57d45f33ec00f6a49e702c86d18b3d","previous_hold_reasons":["FIXED_PARAMETER_DIRECT_SUBTASK"],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":true,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-07/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"95cc2304693f8b80847b4d378c201fd7e2edcafe49408bdebccb8af103fa36da","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-07-draft-c02-01"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"f6e33b10b0f0ee50a281e3067af4023a8f1d15ba312198c0eea0d87d9a36425a","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c02-02","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"反常积分","concept":"无穷限反常积分","concept_id":"C02","parent_training_ids":["calc-improper-002","calc-param-improper-003"],"problem":"在$[1,\\infty)$上定义$g(x)=n$，当$x\\in[n,n+2^{-n}/n]$、$n\\in\\mathbb N^+$时；其余点令$g(x)=0$。证明$g$局部黎曼可积且广义积分收敛，求精确积分值，并判断$\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}g(x)$是否存在。","solution":"每个尖峰宽度为$2^{-n}/n\\le1/2$，支撑区间互不重叠；在任意有界区间上只有有限个跳跃点，函数有界，故黎曼可积。一个完整尖峰面积为$n\\cdot2^{-n}/n=2^{-n}$，因此$\\int_1^{N+1}g=\\sum_{n=1}^N2^{-n}=1-2^{-N}$（$x=N+1$处单点值不影响积分）。由于$g\\ge0$，任意上限$R$可夹在相邻整数上限之间，积分极限存在且等于$1$。取$t_n=n+2^{-n-1}/n$，有$g(t_n)=n\\to\\infty$；取$s_n=n+3/4$，有$g(s_n)=0$。两列都趋于无穷，故函数没有有限极限，也不趋于正无穷。此例证明非负可积函数不必趋于零，也不必全局有界。","answer":"$\\int_1^{\\infty}g(x)\\,dx=1$；$\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}g(x)$不存在，且$g$不趋于零。","method":"可积无界尖峰的反例构造","difficulty":"基础","variant_kind":"局部可积+几何尖峰面积+两子列反证","scene_spec":{"objects":["尖峰高度$n$与宽度$2^{-n}/n$","部分积分$1-2^{-N}$","子列$t_n,s_n$及值$n,0$"],"steps":["第一步:检查尖峰互不重叠与局部有限跳跃。","第二步:计算每个尖峰的精确面积。","第三步:用非负性与整数上限夹逼得到积分。","第四步:取两条明确子列否定函数极限。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"f7fa64a489fd9c4eddb377dfb4be2c87c2a122e1eddfb08605a0417c45908525","math_content_sha256":"3ff7d02c1275454c27893d77afd14ed41fc2fb3ff1e9f03650868196aae62553","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"scene-batch9-v1-draft-c02-02","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-07\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"fe3576287150709fa595d4fe033e69553cfc44acc8bd9441a4226ad815adbbd4","original_id":"draft-c02-02","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-improper-002","calc-param-improper-003"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"9dae02b8edc49d02e1d74f9b092d6ac9d5759d05bb9df1684fcbbc7de8e46652","previous_hold_reasons":["FIXED_PARAMETER_DIRECT_SUBTASK"],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":true,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-07/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"95cc2304693f8b80847b4d378c201fd7e2edcafe49408bdebccb8af103fa36da","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-07-draft-c02-02"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"ba6ffb3cd70ac72e1a8952bf15b83f5e119a527f84d00da74aeb935a1203bb14","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c02-03","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"反常积分","concept":"无穷限反常积分","concept_id":"C02","parent_training_ids":["calc-improper-002","calc-param-improper-003"],"problem":"判断 $\\int_2^{+\\infty}\\frac{1}{x\\ln x}\\,dx$ 与 $\\int_2^{+\\infty}\\frac{1}{x\\ln^2 x}\\,dx$ 的敛散性，并求收敛者的值。","solution":"换元 $u=\\ln x$,$du=\\frac{dx}{x}$。第一个:$\\int_2^R\\frac{1}{x\\ln x}dx=\\int_{\\ln2}^{\\ln R}\\frac{du}{u}=\\ln(\\ln R)-\\ln(\\ln2)\\to+\\infty$,发散。第二个:$\\int_2^R\\frac{1}{x\\ln^2x}dx=\\int_{\\ln2}^{\\ln R}\\frac{du}{u^2}=\\frac{1}{\\ln2}-\\frac{1}{\\ln R}\\to\\frac{1}{\\ln2}$,收敛且值为 $\\frac{1}{\\ln2}$。","answer":"$\\int_2^{+\\infty}\\frac{1}{x\\ln x}dx$ 发散;$\\int_2^{+\\infty}\\frac{1}{x\\ln^2x}dx$ 收敛,值为 $\\frac{1}{\\ln2}$。","method":"换元化为 p 积分","difficulty":"中等","variant_kind":"边界对比:对数因子一阶与二阶的敛散分界(换元后 p 积分)","scene_spec":{"objects":["板书:两个被积函数 $\\frac{1}{x\\ln x}$ 与 $\\frac{1}{x\\ln^2x}$ 并排","板书:换元 $u=\\ln x$ 的推导","坐标图:两条曲线衰减速度对比(一快一慢)","红色标签「发散」与绿色标签「收敛 $=\\frac{1}{\\ln2}$」","板书:极限过程 $\\ln(\\ln R)\\to+\\infty$ 与 $\\frac{1}{\\ln R}\\to0$"],"steps":["第一步:并列写出两个积分,说明差别只在 $\\ln x$ 的幂次。","第二步:换元 $u=\\ln x$,分别化为 $\\int du/u$ 与 $\\int du/u^2$。","第三步:计算第一个的极限,$\\ln(\\ln R)\\to+\\infty$,发散。","第四步:计算第二个的极限,得 $\\frac{1}{\\ln2}$,收敛。","第五步:对照两条曲线的衰减速度,总结对数因子的敛散分界。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"ccc9c251ebc9e97d9c5573c2efc5941620daca118a2d358de7cd32e2c5329989","math_content_sha256":"8ab38227a3d052be918f15c72cf9b663436ee320e2cccc6fdb671326cd73db1a","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"scene-batch9-v1-draft-c02-03","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-07\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"fe3576287150709fa595d4fe033e69553cfc44acc8bd9441a4226ad815adbbd4","original_id":"draft-c02-03","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-improper-002","calc-param-improper-003"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"6fa5958224b8363221e3f266c2aaa85204466a6256c117ab5e45f2ff754ca82a","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-07/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"95cc2304693f8b80847b4d378c201fd7e2edcafe49408bdebccb8af103fa36da","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-07-draft-c02-03"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"8ab38227a3d052be918f15c72cf9b663436ee320e2cccc6fdb671326cd73db1a","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c02-04","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"反常积分","concept":"无穷限反常积分","concept_id":"C02","parent_training_ids":["calc-improper-002","calc-param-improper-003"],"problem":"设$a,b>0$。证明$\\int_0^{\\infty}(e^{-ax}-e^{-bx})/x\\,dx$收敛并求精确值；说明交换积分的依据及为什么不能把它拆成两个广义积分之差。","solution":"对$x>0$有精确恒等式$(e^{-ax}-e^{-bx})/x=\\int_a^be^{-tx}\\,dt$。若$a<b$，二重被积函数非负，Tonelli定理允许交换积分，得$\\int_a^b\\int_0^{\\infty}e^{-tx}\\,dx\\,dt=\\int_a^b1/t\\,dt=\\ln(b/a)<\\infty$；所以原积分绝对收敛。若$a>b$，交换二参数取负；若$a=b$，被积函数恒为零。亦可直接给上界：近零绝对值不超过$|b-a|$，而$R>0$后的绝对尾积分不超过$|b-a|e^{-\\min(a,b)R}/\\min(a,b)$。每个单独的$e^{-ax}/x$在零点附近与$1/x$具有同阶正下界，故从零开始积分发散；原式依赖抵消，不能写成两个未定义的发散积分之差。","answer":"对所有$a,b>0$均绝对收敛，积分精确等于$\\ln(b/a)$。","method":"参数抵消型Frullani积分","difficulty":"中等","variant_kind":"两参数抵消+Tonelli交换+零端不能拆分","scene_spec":{"objects":["$(e^{-ax}-e^{-bx})/x=\\int_a^be^{-tx}\\,dt$","正二重积分交换","$\\ln(b/a)$","零端抵消与精确尾界"],"steps":["第一步:把差商写成参数积分恒等式。","第二步:按参数大小处理符号并说明交换依据。","第三步:求精确对数值与收敛上界。","第四步:证明单独两项发散，解释抵消的必要性。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"1fd4d8f3c753ed4ff200e8946609a720f9d0142c04ee87e7a34355202b802e8b","math_content_sha256":"1896ebd090f99936d5a8a1d15c48ad505c55f791088713f837f6233b74c7c2ef","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"scene-batch9-v1-draft-c02-04","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-07\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"fe3576287150709fa595d4fe033e69553cfc44acc8bd9441a4226ad815adbbd4","original_id":"draft-c02-04","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-improper-002","calc-param-improper-003"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"a1c2ff51db93d2afc00a10f944fd6f33fff7b5803b9b8654878a236bfc1f46f5","previous_hold_reasons":["EXACT_PROBLEM_AND_METHOD"],"math_correction_notes":["用严格指数下界证明边界项极限，不用增长速度的口头估算"],"revised_in_place":true,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-07/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"95cc2304693f8b80847b4d378c201fd7e2edcafe49408bdebccb8af103fa36da","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-07-draft-c02-04"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"4cc39f38d110508bb33693e2f8e1badc2815318b5f4b0ff0456b1a1fe2a0983d","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c02-05","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"反常积分","concept":"无穷限反常积分","concept_id":"C02","parent_training_ids":["calc-improper-002","calc-param-improper-003"],"problem":"对实参数$a$，讨论$\\int_0^{\\infty}x^{a-1}/(1+x)\\,dx$的收敛性，必须同时处理零点与无穷远。并在$a=1/2$时求精确值。","solution":"在$0<x\\le1$，被积函数介于$x^{a-1}/2$与$x^{a-1}$之间；在$x\\ge1$，介于$x^{a-2}/2$与$x^{a-2}$之间。若$0<a<1$，在零端二进分块$[2^{-n-1},2^{-n}]$（$n\\ge0$）上积分不超过$2^{-a(n+1)}$；在无穷端分块$[2^n,2^{n+1}]$上积分不超过$2^{n(a-1)}$。前后两个精确几何级数的公比分别为$2^{-a}<1$、$2^{a-1}<1$，故两个端点均收敛。若$a\\le0$，在$(0,1]$被积函数不小于$1/(2x)$，零端发散；若$a\\ge1$，在$[1,\\infty)$被积函数不小于$1/(2x)$，无穷端发散。这穷尽所有实参数。$a=1/2$时令$x=t^2$，积分为$2\\int_0^{\\infty}1/(1+t^2)\\,dt=2[\\arctan t]_0^{\\infty}=\\pi$。两端分别取极限，不能只检查无穷远而忽略零端。","answer":"收敛当且仅当$0<a<1$；当$a=1/2$时积分等于$\\pi$。","method":"同一参数控制两个广义端点的二进分块","difficulty":"进阶","variant_kind":"两端二进分块+两个几何公比+特殊值换元","scene_spec":{"objects":["零端$a>0$与无穷端$a<1$","参数交集$(0,1)$","$x=t^2$及特殊值$\\pi$"],"steps":["第一步:分别在两个端点建立双边比较。","第二步:求两个收敛条件的交集。","第三步:含端点地证明其余参数发散。","第四步:对$a=1/2$作平方换元并精确积分。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"020211e1b1a9330f91c977909f871b7ab01f18fe17bdf7342f5f15c4cd3854f6","math_content_sha256":"bcf2e008f07349fa7cf940fb360322ac1c3be853724ddc9de08e2b2b2295038a","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"scene-batch9-v1-draft-c02-05","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-07\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"fe3576287150709fa595d4fe033e69553cfc44acc8bd9441a4226ad815adbbd4","original_id":"draft-c02-05","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-improper-002","calc-param-improper-003"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"d88e8be00047cb4b2654ff90f8e3130ad90bf5089f7b1945bb3655e135e24213","previous_hold_reasons":["EXACT_PARAMETRIC_PROBLEM_AND_METHOD"],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":true,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-07/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"95cc2304693f8b80847b4d378c201fd7e2edcafe49408bdebccb8af103fa36da","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-07-draft-c02-05"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"81dc3d7776b14d46ef93db76bee5af64784e02fa02f5a1244c45a65933af4011","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c04-01","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"曲线积分","concept":"格林公式","concept_id":"C04","parent_training_ids":["calc-green-005"],"problem":"用格林公式求 $\\oint_L x^2\\,dy$，其中 $L$ 为以 $(0,0),(1,0),(0,1)$ 为顶点的三角形正向边界，并直接计算验证。","solution":"格林公式:$\\oint_L x^2\\,dy=\\iint_D 2x\\,dxdy$。区域 $D$:$0\\le y\\le1$,$0\\le x\\le1-y$。$\\iint_D 2x\\,dxdy=\\int_0^1\\int_0^{1-y}2x\\,dx\\,dy=\\int_0^1(1-y)^2\\,dy=\\frac13$。直接验证:底边 $y=0$ 上 $dy=0$ 贡献为 $0$;竖边 $x=0$ 上 $x^2=0$ 贡献为 $0$;斜边 $x=1-y$($y$ 从 $0$ 到 $1$):$\\int_0^1(1-y)^2\\,dy=\\frac13$。两法一致。","answer":"积分值为 $\\frac13$(格林公式与直接计算一致)。","method":"格林公式(非对称区域)+直接验证","difficulty":"基础","variant_kind":"区域变化:三角形非对称区域的格林公式应用与双算法互验","scene_spec":{"objects":["平面坐标系:三角形区域(阴影)与正向边界箭头","板书:格林公式 $\\oint x^2\\,dy=\\iint 2x\\,dxdy$","板书:$\\int_0^1(1-y)^2dy=\\frac13$","动画:沿三边的直接积分贡献分解(两零一非零)","高亮框:$\\frac13$(两法一致)"],"steps":["第一步:画出三角形与逆时针边界箭头。","第二步:应用格林公式化为二重积分并计算。","第三步:直接积分:展示底边与竖边贡献为零。","第四步:展示斜边积分 $(1-y)^2$ 的贡献为 $\\frac13$。","第五步:对照两法结果,高亮一致。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"bc3bf1ca3a3cf22c2ce835315fe1b80204bb04099f347b575da389ea2d75ad85","math_content_sha256":"a3704420c58e1e5ee2c91a5c894a97f227345dbedfe9ec1973221aacca6191eb","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"scene-batch9-v1-draft-c04-01","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-07\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"fe3576287150709fa595d4fe033e69553cfc44acc8bd9441a4226ad815adbbd4","original_id":"draft-c04-01","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-green-005"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"637702946f36bb919a3ade1a6a1eb80c029b9d442c2ccc967c98f841996dca41","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-07/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"95cc2304693f8b80847b4d378c201fd7e2edcafe49408bdebccb8af103fa36da","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-07-draft-c04-01"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"a3704420c58e1e5ee2c91a5c894a97f227345dbedfe9ec1973221aacca6191eb","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c04-02","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"曲线积分","concept":"格林公式","concept_id":"C04","parent_training_ids":["calc-green-005"],"problem":"求 $\\oint_L y\\,dx$，其中 $L$ 为逆时针单位圆周；并说明若沿顺时针方向积分，结果如何变化。","solution":"格林公式:$\\oint_L y\\,dx=\\iint_D(0-1)\\,dxdy=-\\iint_D 1\\,dxdy=-A$,其中 $A$ 为区域面积。单位圆面积 $A=\\pi$,故逆时针积分为 $-\\pi$。若改为顺时针,格林公式需取负号(或等价地区域定向反转),结果为 $+\\pi$。","answer":"逆时针为 $-\\pi$;顺时针为 $+\\pi$(符号随定向反转)。","method":"格林公式+方向反转","difficulty":"基础","variant_kind":"方向反转:边界定向对曲线积分符号的影响","scene_spec":{"objects":["平面坐标系:单位圆盘(阴影)与逆时针箭头","板书:$\\oint y\\,dx=\\iint(0-1)dxdy=-A$","高亮框:逆时针 $=-\\pi$","动画:箭头切换为顺时针,符号翻转为 $+\\pi$","标签「定向决定符号」"],"steps":["第一步:画出单位圆与逆时针定向箭头。","第二步:应用格林公式得 $-A=-\\pi$。","第三步:高亮逆时针结果。","第四步:动画切换为顺时针定向,说明格林公式取负。","第五步:汇总:定向反转则符号反转。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"97f5a4815740d7ae9199c77d0ca3fb5dee0b16c44544a12abbfbd241e97963ed","math_content_sha256":"6a41ce2f144f943a3f8cb66af63191bb599831ff820c1043419936767cdebe2f","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"scene-batch9-v1-draft-c04-02","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-07\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"fe3576287150709fa595d4fe033e69553cfc44acc8bd9441a4226ad815adbbd4","original_id":"draft-c04-02","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-green-005"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"e1e73ccea526be8711ccd5bcc51fde6f3c4fd1d95b2d5d6541ea5b4e90f35609","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-07/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"95cc2304693f8b80847b4d378c201fd7e2edcafe49408bdebccb8af103fa36da","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-07-draft-c04-02"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"6a41ce2f144f943a3f8cb66af63191bb599831ff820c1043419936767cdebe2f","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c04-03","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"曲线积分","concept":"格林公式","concept_id":"C04","parent_training_ids":["calc-green-005"],"problem":"用格林公式求 $\\oint_L -y^3\\,dx+x^3\\,dy$，其中 $L$ 为圆环 $1\\le x^2+y^2\\le4$ 的边界(外圆逆时针、内圆顺时针)，并说明内外圆方向相反的原因。","solution":"格林公式(区域 $D$ 为圆环):$\\oint_L -y^3dx+x^3dy=\\iint_D\\left(\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}x^3-\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y}(-y^3)\\right)dxdy=\\iint_D(3x^2+3y^2)\\,dxdy=3\\iint_D r^2\\cdot r\\,dr\\,d\\theta=3\\int_0^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_1^2r^3\\,dr=3\\times2\\pi\\times\\frac{2^4-1^4}{4}=\\frac{45\\pi}{2}$。方向:为使区域 $D$ 总在边界的左侧(正向),外边界须逆时针、内边界须顺时针。","answer":"积分值为 $\\frac{45\\pi}{2}$;外逆内顺保证区域在边界左侧(正向)。","method":"格林公式(有洞区域)","difficulty":"中等","variant_kind":"有洞区域:圆环的格林公式应用与多连通区域定向规则","scene_spec":{"objects":["平面坐标系:圆环区域(阴影)与外逆内顺的边界箭头","板书:被积函数偏导差 $3x^2+3y^2$","板书:极坐标计算 $3\\times2\\pi\\times\\frac{15}{4}$","高亮框:$\\frac{45\\pi}{2}$","标签「多连通区域:外逆内顺」"],"steps":["第一步:画出圆环与两条边界曲线,标注外逆内顺箭头。","第二步:写出偏导差 $3x^2+3y^2$ 的二重积分。","第三步:极坐标化并计算径向积分。","第四步:高亮结果 $\\frac{45\\pi}{2}$。","第五步:说明多连通区域正向规则(区域在边界左侧)。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"1b3244edd9a2bc0e589e0c638195617f6c13dc7a2872c98ba288aa491da0cf69","math_content_sha256":"137a698851d5cb7bddfa3877a0c0f51d36cf77e0997a9f001dc2fcdaca31f1fc","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"scene-batch9-v1-draft-c04-03","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-07\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"fe3576287150709fa595d4fe033e69553cfc44acc8bd9441a4226ad815adbbd4","original_id":"draft-c04-03","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-green-005"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"f3cdb78697d8ca4043d18f90fcd1d988659df953f2a67788f357059364e9fc8b","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-07/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"95cc2304693f8b80847b4d378c201fd7e2edcafe49408bdebccb8af103fa36da","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-07-draft-c04-03"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"137a698851d5cb7bddfa3877a0c0f51d36cf77e0997a9f001dc2fcdaca31f1fc","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c04-04","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"曲线积分","concept":"格林公式","concept_id":"C04","parent_training_ids":["calc-green-005"],"problem":"用格林公式(补边闭合)计算曲线积分 $\\int_L (x+y)\\,dx+x\\,dy$，其中 $L$ 为抛物线 $y=x^2$ 上从 $(0,0)$ 到 $(1,1)$ 的弧段。","solution":"补直线段 $L'$:从 $(1,1)$ 沿直线回到 $(0,0)$,$L+L'$ 为闭合曲线。区域 $D$ 内,$\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}-\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}=\\frac{\\partial x}{\\partial x}-\\frac{\\partial(x+y)}{\\partial y}=1-1=0$,故 $\\oint_{L+L'}=0$,于是 $\\int_L=-\\int_{L'}$。参数化 $L'$:$(1-t,1-t)$,$t\\in[0,1]$,$dx=dy=-dt$:$\\int_{L'}(x+y)dx+x\\,dy=\\int_0^1\\left[(2-2t)(-1)+(1-t)(-1)\\right]dt=\\int_0^1(3t-3)\\,dt=-\\frac32$。故 $\\int_L=\\frac32$。","answer":"积分值为 $\\frac32$(补边闭合,格林公式得闭合积分为零)。","method":"补边法(非闭合曲线+格林公式)","difficulty":"中等","variant_kind":"适用条件:非闭合曲线补边闭合后应用格林公式","scene_spec":{"objects":["平面坐标系:抛物线弧段 $L$(从 $(0,0)$ 到 $(1,1)$)与补边直线段(虚线)","区域 $D$(阴影)与闭合定向箭头","板书:$\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}-\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}=1-1=0$","板书:补边积分 $\\int_{L'}(3t-3)dt=-\\frac32$","高亮框:$\\int_L=\\frac32$"],"steps":["第一步:画出抛物线弧段,并用虚线补上直线段形成闭合回路。","第二步:计算区域内的偏导差,得零。","第三步:由格林公式得闭合积分为零,故 $\\int_L=-\\int_{L'}$。","第四步:参数化补边线段并计算 $-\\frac32$。","第五步:取负得 $\\frac32$,高亮结论。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"703c07373ad0f6d810b40a03910d3da0143513ea3367d0a55cdf0f8a71728c42","math_content_sha256":"5926dab4985e1f88c1a4d75332dcf17a4945abcfa03dffbed8106c50e5e585bd","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"scene-batch9-v1-draft-c04-04","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-07\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"fe3576287150709fa595d4fe033e69553cfc44acc8bd9441a4226ad815adbbd4","original_id":"draft-c04-04","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-green-005"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"fee155aff29dd6522edc4fe88d0427c8ac8a21e61079bda4af90a0b6a495b351","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-07/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"95cc2304693f8b80847b4d378c201fd7e2edcafe49408bdebccb8af103fa36da","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-07-draft-c04-04"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"5926dab4985e1f88c1a4d75332dcf17a4945abcfa03dffbed8106c50e5e585bd","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c04-05","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"曲线积分","concept":"格林公式","concept_id":"C04","parent_training_ids":["calc-green-005"],"problem":"设$P=-2y/(x^2+y^2)+3y/((x-3)^2+y^2)$，$Q=2x/(x^2+y^2)-3(x-3)/((x-3)^2+y^2)$。取圆盘$(x-3/2)^2+y^2\\le16$，挖去以$(0,0)$、$(3,0)$为中心、半径$1/2$的两个开圆盘，得区域$D$。分别求外圆逆时针及两个内圆顺时针的积分$\\oint P\\,dx+Q\\,dy$，并验证正向总边界的Green公式。","solution":"两小圆盘互不相交且严格在大圆盘内。$P,Q$在$\\overline D$的某邻域中连续可微，直接求导得$Q_x-P_y=0$。以原点为中心的场$(-ky/r^2,kx/r^2)$沿逆时针圆的积分为$2\\pi k$，由$x=r\\cos t,y=r\\sin t$可直接得到被积表达式$k\\,dt$；顺时针则取负。第一孔中心场权重$2$，给顺时针积分$-4\\pi$；第二孔中心场权重$-3$，给顺时针积分$6\\pi$。对每个孔，另一中心的场在该孔闭圆盘附近光滑且旋度零，Green公式给其圆周积分为零。对带两孔区域正确应用Green公式，外圆积分$I_{\\rm out}$加两个顺时针内圆积分等于$0$，故$I_{\\rm out}-4\\pi+6\\pi=0$，即$I_{\\rm out}=-2\\pi$。总正向边界积分为零。不能把外圆所围实心圆盘直接用于Green公式，因为该实心盘包含两个奇点。","answer":"外圆逆时针$-2\\pi$；原点孔顺时针$-4\\pi$；$(3,0)$孔顺时针$6\\pi$；正向总边界积分为$0$。","method":"多连通区域Green公式与奇点环流","difficulty":"进阶","variant_kind":"两孔正向边界+两中心环流+适用域检查","scene_spec":{"objects":["大圆盘及两个孔","外逆时针、内顺时针箭头","环流$-4\\pi,6\\pi,-2\\pi$","总边界与奇点不可填补提示"],"steps":["第一步:检查区域与场的光滑适用范围。","第二步:求旋度并直接参数化各奇点自身环流。","第三步:对另一中心的光滑场求零贡献。","第四步:把两个顺时针内边界纳入Green公式求外环流。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"7ccf50cd13a448dd57901200d59fdfe62df3a269b49fa0741ef078bd08899b57","math_content_sha256":"d5c9af21288c02fbd8351842897468c86d70da45d76778240cb7ee4d1c5a10d2","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"scene-batch9-v1-draft-c04-05","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-07\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"fe3576287150709fa595d4fe033e69553cfc44acc8bd9441a4226ad815adbbd4","original_id":"draft-c04-05","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-green-005"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"d11934a63d5fc42bdde4a7927f721f2a4611561a20b6534b0a18248ef78d36ab","previous_hold_reasons":["EXACT_PROBLEM_AND_METHOD"],"math_correction_notes":["补正向一次遍历及椭圆半轴正性，避免符号和退化情形错误"],"revised_in_place":true,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-07/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"95cc2304693f8b80847b4d378c201fd7e2edcafe49408bdebccb8af103fa36da","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-07-draft-c04-05"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"ddc3ff92ce7a83951cb67a97b5e3bda2eff83608bc841459741c48925d66dfa9","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c06-01","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"定积分应用","concept":"直角坐标面积与分段","concept_id":"C06","parent_training_ids":["calc-area-007","calc-area-010","calc-area-011","calc-area-013"],"problem":"求由抛物线 $y=x^2$ 与 $y=2-x^2$ 围成的封闭图形的面积。","solution":"交点:$x^2=2-x^2$ 得 $x=\\pm1$。利用对称性,$A=\\int_{-1}^{1}\\left[(2-x^2)-x^2\\right]dx=2\\int_0^1(2-2x^2)\\,dx=2\\left.\\left(2x-\\frac{2x^3}{3}\\right)\\right|_0^1=2\\times\\frac43=\\frac83$。","answer":"面积为 $\\frac83$。","method":"上下曲线相减(对称简化)","difficulty":"基础","variant_kind":"曲线组合变化:两条抛物线围成的对称区域","scene_spec":{"objects":["平面坐标系:两条抛物线 $y=x^2$ 与 $y=2-x^2$","两抛物线围成的封闭区域(阴影)","两个交点 $(-1,1)$ 与 $(1,1)$ 高亮","板书:$A=2\\int_0^1(2-2x^2)dx$","高亮框:$\\frac83$"],"steps":["第一步:画出两条抛物线,高亮两个交点。","第二步:阴影标出围成区域,说明上下曲线的位置。","第三步:写出积分并利用对称性简化。","第四步:计算得 $\\frac83$。","第五步:高亮结论。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"e13d2805407da196c52cea9594c8fe6a1d070ea58873515cb0988d3e4f0a49ce","math_content_sha256":"1d634448d9c2a263f9931b9c3089bb3a16188985af1ab701486009149124c589","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"scene-batch9-v1-draft-c06-01","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-07\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"fe3576287150709fa595d4fe033e69553cfc44acc8bd9441a4226ad815adbbd4","original_id":"draft-c06-01","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-area-007","calc-area-010","calc-area-011","calc-area-013"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"063bbf30ccb4ab85f6ccf2812b3b5e38f00df6caf376fb80f9e08aa77861502b","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-07/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"95cc2304693f8b80847b4d378c201fd7e2edcafe49408bdebccb8af103fa36da","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-07-draft-c06-01"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"1d634448d9c2a263f9931b9c3089bb3a16188985af1ab701486009149124c589","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c06-02","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"定积分应用","concept":"直角坐标面积与分段","concept_id":"C06","parent_training_ids":["calc-area-007","calc-area-010","calc-area-011","calc-area-013"],"problem":"求由 $y=|x|$ 与 $y=1$ 围成的封闭图形的面积。","solution":"交点:$|x|=1$ 得 $x=\\pm1$。区域关于 $y$ 轴对称,右半部分为 $0\\le x\\le1$,$|x|\\le y\\le1$。$A=2\\int_0^1(1-x)\\,dx=2\\left.\\left(x-\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right)\\right|_0^1=2\\times\\frac12=1$。","answer":"面积为 $1$。","method":"绝对值分段+对称性","difficulty":"基础","variant_kind":"绝对值函数与水平线的围成区域(分段后对称简化)","scene_spec":{"objects":["平面坐标系:折线 $y=|x|$ 与水平线 $y=1$","围成的三角形区域(阴影)","两个交点 $(-1,1)$ 与 $(1,1)$ 高亮","板书:$A=2\\int_0^1(1-x)dx$","高亮框:$1$"],"steps":["第一步:画出折线 $y=|x|$ 与水平线,高亮交点。","第二步:阴影标出围成的等腰三角形。","第三步:利用对称性写出一半区域积分。","第四步:计算得 $1$。","第五步:高亮结论。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"5e461b6526adaa3b2984d9feaa243eebeeb74ba1636e14c169ed2f7903f38743","math_content_sha256":"adb1fd3b2ca4fc4252b803e7104f17f933eae2f16e00038278bfb603ccf42c76","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"scene-batch9-v1-draft-c06-02","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-07\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"fe3576287150709fa595d4fe033e69553cfc44acc8bd9441a4226ad815adbbd4","original_id":"draft-c06-02","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-area-007","calc-area-010","calc-area-011","calc-area-013"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"22e67d8ea195faa3413f1e5e11a492cd12940e11d8b4a7b2edaf3aa2b6267211","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-07/draft-codex-repair-