{"id":"draft-c06-03","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"定积分应用","concept":"直角坐标面积与分段","concept_id":"C06","parent_training_ids":["calc-area-007","calc-area-010","calc-area-011","calc-area-013"],"problem":"求由抛物线 $x=y^2$ 与直线 $y=x-2$ 围成的封闭图形的面积(按 $y$ 积分)。","solution":"交点:$y^2=y+2$,即 $y^2-y-2=0$,得 $y=-1$ 与 $y=2$。区域在 $y$ 方向的范围为 $[-1,2]$,右边界为直线 $x=y+2$,左边界为抛物线 $x=y^2$。$A=\\int_{-1}^{2}\\left[(y+2)-y^2\\right]dy=\\left.\\left(\\frac{y^2}{2}+2y-\\frac{y^3}{3}\\right)\\right|_{-1}^{2}=\\left(2+4-\\frac83\\right)-\\left(\\frac12-2+\\frac13\\right)=\\frac{10}{3}+\\frac76=\\frac92$。","answer":"面积为 $\\frac92$。","method":"按 y 积分(左右曲线相减)","difficulty":"中等","variant_kind":"积分方向变化:横向区域的按 y 积分路径","scene_spec":{"objects":["平面坐标系:抛物线 $x=y^2$ 与直线 $y=x-2$","围成的封闭区域(阴影)","两个交点 $(1,-1)$ 与 $(4,2)$ 高亮","板书:$A=\\int_{-1}^2[(y+2)-y^2]dy$","高亮框:$\\frac92$"],"steps":["第一步:画出抛物线与直线,解出交点对应的 $y$ 值。","第二步:阴影标出区域,说明按 $y$ 方向积分的原因(区域横向)。","第三步:写出左右曲线相减的积分。","第四步:计算得 $\\frac92$。","第五步:高亮结论。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"3db651451c0fbbf76a2cfd2590db7e71542cae38c04cd68e242ee38eac8fa1f7","math_content_sha256":"9960d22ab6da6895e740a3e2a63c3fff1a9d23e0a8adb997238b709cc0b69054","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"scene-batch9-v1-draft-c06-03","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-07\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"fe3576287150709fa595d4fe033e69553cfc44acc8bd9441a4226ad815adbbd4","original_id":"draft-c06-03","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-area-007","calc-area-010","calc-area-011","calc-area-013"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"132cd2edef59ba7b83c3a70af618f02e544cc72f1a0ed9f5ee6fb1658a24e767","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-07/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"95cc2304693f8b80847b4d378c201fd7e2edcafe49408bdebccb8af103fa36da","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-07-draft-c06-03"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"9960d22ab6da6895e740a3e2a63c3fff1a9d23e0a8adb997238b709cc0b69054","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c06-04","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"定积分应用","concept":"直角坐标面积与分段","concept_id":"C06","parent_training_ids":["calc-area-007","calc-area-010","calc-area-011","calc-area-013"],"problem":"求由抛物线 $y=x^2$ 与直线 $y=kx$($k>0$)围成的封闭图形的面积(用 $k$ 表示)，并求 $k=2$ 时的面积。","solution":"交点:$x^2=kx$ 得 $x=0$ 与 $x=k$。在 $[0,k]$ 上,$kx\\ge x^2$。$A(k)=\\int_0^k(kx-x^2)\\,dx=\\left.\\left(\\frac{kx^2}{2}-\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right)\\right|_0^k=\\frac{k^3}{2}-\\frac{k^3}{3}=\\frac{k^3}{6}$。当 $k=2$ 时,$A=\\frac{2^3}{6}=\\frac43$。","answer":"$A(k)=\\frac{k^3}{6}$;$k=2$ 时面积为 $\\frac43$。","method":"含参面积(交点随参数变化)","difficulty":"中等","variant_kind":"参数依赖:交点与面积均随参数变化的含参面积公式","scene_spec":{"objects":["平面坐标系:抛物线 $y=x^2$ 与直线族 $y=kx$(动画:$k$ 滑动)","围成的区域(阴影随 $k$ 变化)","两个交点 $(0,0)$ 与 $(k,k^2)$ 高亮","板书:$A(k)=\\frac{k^3}{6}$","高亮框:$k=2$ 时 $\\frac43$"],"steps":["第一步:动画滑动直线 $y=kx$,展示交点随 $k$ 移动。","第二步:写出积分 $\\int_0^k(kx-x^2)dx$。","第三步:计算得 $A(k)=\\frac{k^3}{6}$。","第四步:代入 $k=2$,得 $\\frac43$。","第五步:高亮结论。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"f170fc0239863bc16e4f28b6b26bb1ea67fea127a3801dd85fc25c05cad39f9e","math_content_sha256":"c5c5c8813284e2da8a1dba5e844bc139781daba093e163e38bb1ef868c46164c","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"scene-batch9-v1-draft-c06-04","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-07\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"fe3576287150709fa595d4fe033e69553cfc44acc8bd9441a4226ad815adbbd4","original_id":"draft-c06-04","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-area-007","calc-area-010","calc-area-011","calc-area-013"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"7d38401571b6ef8797556823824c3940d200626b97cb54e15f716921239a06d8","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_pla